[3] Marshall, E. J., & Valentine, J. W. (2006).  The Cambrian explosion: a test of the arms race hypothesis. *Palaeoecology*, *137*, 205-220. [https://www.science.org/content/article/cambrian-explosion-still-mystery]
[4] Butterfield, S. J. (2009).  Taphonomy: the study of decay. *Science*, *326*(5956), 823-824.
